✅ Practical 6: Word Cloud
🎯 Aim:

To visualize text data.

💻 Code:

from wordcloud import WordCloud
import matplotlib.pyplot as plt

text = "Data science is powerful and useful"

wc = WordCloud().generate(text)

plt.imshow(wc)
plt.axis("off")
plt.show()

🗣️ Viva:

WordCloud shows most frequent words visually.
